<main>
  <%- include('partials/flash') %>
  <section class="sd-page-header">
    <div class="sd-page-header-inner">
      <h1>Support software built by support people</h1>
      <p>We started ServiceDesk after a decade of drowning in shared inboxes and spreadsheets.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sd-about-body">
    <div class="sd-about-body-inner">
      <p>
        ServiceDesk began as an internal tool for a 12-person IT team that had outgrown
        email. Today it helps support and IT teams of every size route, resolve, and
        report on the work that keeps their companies running &mdash; without the setup
        time of legacy ITSM platforms.
      </p>
      <p>
        We believe good support software should get out of the way: fast to set up,
        simple for agents, and clear for the managers who have to report on it.
      </p>

      <div class="sd-about-stats">
        <div class="sd-about-stat"><strong>2,400+</strong><span>Teams supported</span></div>
        <div class="sd-about-stat"><strong>4.2M</strong><span>Tickets resolved</span></div>
        <div class="sd-about-stat"><strong>98%</strong><span>Average CSAT</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <%- include('partials/home-cta') %>
</main>
